   "subject": "Re: Different values returned by REPORT vs ADREPORT",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">For anyone who comes across the same issue later on - the answer was that I wasn&#39;t explicitly calling the reported values using the best fitting parameters. My call to obj$report() should actually have been obj$report(obj$env$last.par.best).<div>Thanks to Jim Thorson for his assistance.</div><div>Jon</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
